    {
      "text": "Elijah went up by a whirlwind into heaven, 2 Kgs. 2:11. Lord answered Job out of the whirlwind, Job 38:1. As the whirlwind passeth, so is the wicked no more, Prov. 10:25. their wheels like a whirlwind, Isa. 5:28 (2 Ne. 15:28). whirlwind shall take them away as stubble, Isa. 40:24. with his chariots like a whirlwind, Isa. 66:15 (Dan. 11:40). whirlwind of the Lord is gone forth in fury, Jer. 23:19 (30:23). great whirlwind shall be raised up from the coasts, Jer. 25:32. whirlwind came out of the north, Ezek. 1:4. they shall reap the whirlwind, Hosea 8:7.",
